{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND A GUN AND GET SOME MEAT! THE TRAIN IS HUNGRY..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yourself in a wasteland full of zombies, monsters and machines that all want you dead.\u00a0<br>You start with only a melee weapon and an oxygen tank to help you breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge the world for weapons, ammo, scrap and upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/d6413911c68db469df9545b2271ff50c.poster.avif?t=1771320063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/d6413911c68db469df9545b2271ff50c.webm?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/d6413911c68db469df9545b2271ff50c.mp4?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to your survival is <strong>MEAT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>MEAT TRAIN</strong> is your only hope of surviving, especially when the sun goes down...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll need as much MEAT as you can get.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/88149d2c814bb4bfa731458bc6b1bf5e.poster.avif?t=1771320063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/88149d2c814bb4bfa731458bc6b1bf5e.webm?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/88149d2c814bb4bfa731458bc6b1bf5e.mp4?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the train tracks and you will find many monuments to explore and loot, the further you venture from the starting farm area, the better the loot you will find - but also the harder the enemies will become.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE THE TRAIN</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>SCRAP\u00a0</strong>by breaking crates and destroying machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCRAP</strong> can be used to repair and upgrade the train. There are a variety of upgrades to unlock which you will need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/b3f35dafc81e4a30d99eb3c4f7d06bcf.poster.avif?t=1771320063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/b3f35dafc81e4a30d99eb3c4f7d06bcf.webm?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/b3f35dafc81e4a30d99eb3c4f7d06bcf.mp4?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEATH IS A REWARD, EARN CASH TO SPEND AT THE GUN SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upon death, you earn MONEY</strong> for your Kill Count + Meat Collected + Scrap Collected during your run.<br>Money can be spent in the gun shop to <strong>unlock new weapons</strong> and <strong>gamble on a random weapon</strong> for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/fe393752e5f180b67ef643027b472b6e.poster.avif?t=1771320063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/fe393752e5f180b67ef643027b472b6e.webm?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/fe393752e5f180b67ef643027b472b6e.mp4?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY THE EVIL AI MEGAFACTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to destroy GRM (Global Resource Management): A rogue AI that poisoned the earth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to overcome the basics of surviving this world, you can attempt to penetrate the defenses of the factory and cleanse the planet of the evil AI virus.<br> </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/c05966e2d8f05f9eb1a01d6b63df04bf900cf759.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/541956d38c4486daa4b5be1745da921913ea18d9.jpg"},{"name":"Exterminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/0be528d0df967107c73c08b66e6b49ef48b8e558.jpg"},{"name":"MEAT MEAT MEAT MEAT MEAT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/c71c839cf18d8ba2d67b4490157b38b9ef629eaa.jpg"},{"name":"Humans always prevail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/ae071d5fe099b50d710f0ead915cb630b1d50606.jpg"},{"name":"Pesky drones!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/c7631e9b758f26738542704352fdefa64619a439.jpg"},{"name":"How would you like that cooked?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/c95ba0901a989aae1c16fb716c89b6d6b8f77f19.jpg"},{"name":"Who's a good boy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/f25746ce9ee7335a23473559a97883fa7cb103c8.jpg"},{"name":"Finders Keepers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/3d3e6466a882a744f2bcaee6625e7a783c054862.jpg"},{"name":"Loot Fiend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3216230/e3863fda3b4ff93517a1af82e1056b3f1d58de3a.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216230?t=1771320063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3216230?t=1771320063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/a6763ee57f5389b36fa81f8b898f2119eff9efb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771320063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/a6763ee57f5389b36fa81f8b898f2119eff9efb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771320063","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Retro graphics: cartoon violence, blood and gore.\r\nElements of horror. \r\nSpooky monsters.\r\nMachines that are conceptually horrific as they use meat as fuel."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND A GUN AND GET SOME MEAT! THE TRAIN IS HUNGRY..</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find yourself in a wasteland full of zombies, monsters and machines that all want you dead.\u00a0<br>You start with only a melee weapon and an oxygen tank to help you breathe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge the world for weapons, ammo, scrap and upgrades.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/d6413911c68db469df9545b2271ff50c.poster.avif?t=1771320063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extr