/3216230/extras/b3f35dafc81e4a30d99eb3c4f7d06bcf.poster.avif?t=1771320063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/b3f35dafc81e4a30d99eb3c4f7d06bcf.webm?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/b3f35dafc81e4a30d99eb3c4f7d06bcf.mp4?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEATH IS A REWARD, EARN CASH TO SPEND AT THE GUN SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upon death, you earn MONEY</strong> for your Kill Count + Meat Collected + Scrap Collected during your run.<br>Money can be spent in the gun shop to <strong>unlock new weapons</strong> and <strong>gamble on a random weapon</strong> for your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/fe393752e5f180b67ef643027b472b6e.poster.avif?t=1771320063\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/fe393752e5f180b67ef643027b472b6e.webm?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3216230/extras/fe393752e5f180b67ef643027b472b6e.mp4?t=1771320063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY THE EVIL AI MEGAFACTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to destroy GRM (Global Resource Management): A rogue AI that poisoned the earth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to overcome the basics of surviving this world, you can attempt to penetrate the defenses of the factory and cleanse the planet of the evil AI virus.<br> </p>","developers":["Kiwiforge","Timothy Vincent"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}